#====================================================================
# Draft: embedmq 1.0.1 - Conan 2 manual packaging for upstream CMake
#        projects WITHOUT install() rules (empty package / G2 fail)
#====================================================================

id:                     DRAFT-EMBEDMQ-0101-CONAN2-NO-INSTALL-RULES-MANUAL-PACKAGING
trigger_tool:           conan|conan create|conan-verify|cmake
phase:                  packaging|testing
error_signature:        No files in this package|Library '.*' not found in package|Error in package\(\) method|has no attribute 'copy'|'src' and 'dst' arguments must have different values

severity:               2
category:               conan|packaging|cmake|conan2
match_keywords:         conan 2, conan.tools.files.copy, self.copy, copy pattern, src dst, keep_path,
  package_folder, build_folder, source_folder, no install rules, install(), empty package,
  Library not found in package, cmakedeps, CMakeDeps, test_package, G2

title:                  Conan 2 配方手动打包规范化：上游 CMake 工程无 install() 规则时，
  package() 必须用 conan.tools.files.copy 把产物显式拷入 package_folder（相对 dst/src 同名字面量被拒，
  旧 self.copy API 已移除）

root_cause:             上游 CMakeLists 只 add_library / add_executable 而不写 install() 规则时，
  cmake.install() 实际不产生任何文件 → conan create 生成空包（"No files in this package!"），
  test_package 的 CMakeDeps 找不到库（"Library 'embedmq' not found in package"）。
  修复须在 package() 手工拷贝，但 Conan 2 有三处 API 差异：
  (1) self.copy() 已移除，必须 from conan.tools.files import copy 再 copy(self, pattern, src, dst)；
  (2) dst 若与 src 同名字面量（如 src="include" 且 dst="include"）直接抛
      "copy() 'src' and 'dst' arguments must have different values"；
  (3) dst 必须是 os.path.join(self.package_folder, ...) 的绝对路径（Conan 2 不再把相对 dst
      自动落到 package_folder 下）。

affected_scope:         所有上游 CMake 工程缺失 install() 规则、靠 Conan 2 配方打包的库；
  尤其小型单目标库（静态库 + 公开头文件）直接命中。

verification_cmd:       find <cache>/p -name 'lib*.a' ; grep -rn "install(" <src>/CMakeLists.txt ; find <pkg>/p -type f

rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           conan2-manual-copy-into-package-folder
rec_description:        package() 内：先从 conan.tools.files 导入 copy；用
  copy(self, "libX.a", dst=os.path.join(self.package_folder, "lib"),
       src=self.build_folder, keep_path=False) 拷库、用 src=os.path.join(self.source_folder,
       "include") 拷头文件；所有 dst 一律以 self.package_folder 为根的绝对路径；
  勿用 self.copy，勿让 src/dst 字面量相同。改完 rm 缓存中陈旧空包（conan remove "pkg/ver*" -c）
  再 conan-verify，避免命中旧 package revision。
rec_command:            copy(self, "libname.a", dst=os.path.join(self.package_folder, "lib"),
       src=self.build_folder, keep_path=False) && conan remove "name/ver*" -c
rec_auto_fix:           false

# ═══ 知识协作 (Authorship & Provenance) ═══
source_pr:              (embedmq 1.0.1 适配 PR，创建后回填)
source_commit:          (embedmq 1.0.1 适配 commit，创建后回填)
observed_by:            pc1-27 (AtomCode oh-executor embedmq 1.0.1 R01)